      "text":"credit cards are made for humans: centrally issued, tied to identities, and subject to rampant fraud\n\nBitcoin is made for machines: decentralized, permissionless, and the native currency of the Internet 🌐\n\nw/ L402+MPP (by @tempo) over the Lightning Network any existing inference"
